   "score": 0.9503,
   "kind": "data"
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "text": "辛焱",
   "cx": 410,
   "cy": 403,
   "bbox": [
    371,
    384,
    449,
    423
   ],
   "w": 78,
   "h": 39,
   "score": 0.9879,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "text": "你或许不知道，最近这段时间，我可是被家里给练惨了，又是跟着商队",
   "cx": 1847,
   "cy": 446,
   "bbox": [
    1320,
    426,
    2374,
    465
   ],
   "w": 1054,
   "h": 39,
   "score": 0.999,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "text": "新",
   "cx": 1220,
   "cy": 474,
   "bbox": [
    1197,
    452,
    1243,
    496
   ],
   "w": 46,
   "h": 44,
   "score": 1.0,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "text": "祝他成功。",
   "cx": 431,
   "cy": 502,
   "bbox": [
    336,
    478,
    526,
    527
   ],
   "w": 190,
   "h": 49,
   "score": 0.9999,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "text": "四处游历，又是陪着大哥去见生意伙伴…看我累得不行，大哥就私下和",
   "cx": 1852,
   "cy": 488,
   "bbox": [
    1318,
    469,
    2385,
    507
   ],
   "w": 1067,
   "h": 38,
   "score": 0.9987,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "text": "我说，如果我不愿意的话，那他便去和家里人再说说。",
   "cx": 1720,
   "cy": 532,
   "bbox": [
    1318,
    513,
    2122,
    551
   ],
   "w": 804,
   "h": 38,
   "score": 0.9978,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "text": "欧洛伦",
   "cx": 428,
   "cy": 560,
   "bbox": [
    378,
    540,
    478,
    581
   ],
   "w": 100,
   "h": 41,
   "score": 0.9995,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "text": "我见他眼角的皱纹如山岳裂谷，鬓角也不知何时落下了雪色…我不愿",
   "cx": 1841,
   "cy": 574,
   "bbox": [
    1318,
    555,
    2363,
    594
   ],
   "w": 1045,
   "h": 39,
   "score": 0.9972,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "text": "新",
   "cx": 1220,
   "cy": 629,
   "bbox": [
    1196,
    608,
    1245,
    651
   ],
   "w": 49,
   "h": 43,
   "score": 1.0,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "text": "意四个字，却是怎么也说不出口了。",
   "cx": 1586,
   "cy": 617,
   "bbox": [
    1317,
    596,
    1855,
    639
   ],
   "w": 538,
   "h": 43,
   "score": 0.9873,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 23,
   "text": "舞台·",
   "cx": 386,
   "cy": 660,
   "bbox": [
    335,
    635,
    437,
    686
   ],
   "w": 102,
   "h": 51,
   "score": 0.9752,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 24,
   "text": "侠之大者，为家为国，为义为理…可不能只为了自己啊。",
   "cx": 1736,
   "cy": 660,
   "bbox": [
    1318,
    641,
    2154,
    680
   ],
   "w": 836,
   "h": 39,
   "score": 0.9986,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 25,
   "text": "在这之后，我会跟着大哥正式学习，和他共同打理家里的事务。到时候",
   "cx": 1847,
   "cy": 703,
   "bbox": [
    1316,
    681,
    2379,
    725
   ],
   "w": 1063,
   "h": 44,
   "score": 0.9994,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 26,
   "text": "芙宁娜",
   "cx": 425,
   "cy": 716,
   "bbox": [
    372,
    696,
    477,
    736
   ],
   "w": 105,
   "h": 40,
   "score": 0.9995,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 27,
   "text": "，我可能就真要忙昏头了。",
   "cx": 1516,
   "cy": 747,
   "bbox": [
    1321,
    727,
    1710,
    766
   ],
   "w": 389,
   "h": 39,
   "score": 0.9999,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 28,
   "text": "但现在，我还是偷出了一日闲暇，若是你有空的话，不如和我一起坐坐",
   "cx": 1847,
   "cy": 790,
   "bbox": [
    1318,
    768,
    2376,
    811
   ],
   "w": 1058,
   "h": 43,
   "score": 0.9995,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 29,
   "text": "行到闲处…",
   "cx": 434,
   "cy": 815,
   "bbox": [
    325,
    789,
    544,
    840
   ],
   "w": 219,
   "h": 51,
   "score": 0.9993,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 30,
   "text": "？再喝几杯茶，就当作…",
   "cx": 1509,
   "cy": 833,
   "bbox": [
    1320,
    813,
    1699,
    852
   ],
   "w": 379,
   "h": 39,
   "score": 0.9953,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 31,
